<title>UK: Finelist raises year pre-tax profits 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Finelist raises year pre-tax profits 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		17.8		   vs 15.3</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 6.4		    vs 5.4</p>
<p> Pretax		     8.55		   vs 7.19</p>
<p> Turnover		   107.91		 vs 98.13</p>
<p> Operating profit	 9.09		   vs 7.93</p>
<p> Interest payable	 0.69		   vs 0.75</p>
<p> Tax			  2.73		   vs 2.35</p>
<p> Net taxed		  5.82		   vs 4.84</p>
<p> Retained		   3.71		   vs 3.07</p>
<p> Pay date		   October 22</p>
<p>Div registration date  September 24  Ex-div date		September 16</p>
<p>NOTE - Automotive components and accessories company Finelist Group Plc said its performance since the start of the current financial year has been strong.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
